        <Param val="True" valType="bool" updates="None" name="syncScreenRefresh"/>
        <Param val="Welcome to the experiment!&amp;#10;In this task, you will see words displayed in different ink colours.&amp;#10;Your task is to identify the **INK COLOUR** of each word, NOT the meaning of the word.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press the following keys:&amp;#10;R = RED&amp;#10;B = BLUE&amp;#10;G = GREEN&amp;#10;Y = YELLOW&amp;#10;&amp;#10;**Example:** If the word GRASS appears in RED ink, press R, regardless of what the word means.&amp;#10;Please respond as quickly and accurately as possible.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;You will first complete a short practice session to familiarise yourself with the task.&amp;#10;The main experiment consists of 384 trials, divided into four blocks. You will have opportunities to take short breaks between blocks.&amp;#10;&amp;#10;Press SPACE to begin the practice session." valType="str" updates="constant" name="text"/>
